  "comments": "<p><strong><u>VARIANTS:</u></strong><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f1cc66302e18.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f1cc66302e18.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Wide Braille code/narrow Braille code (narrow only detected on some 1991 and 1992 issues).<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5da1caa96c547.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5da1caa96c547.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>With Chavez signature variant, only detected on some 1993 issues.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/569663f970e56.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/569663f970e56.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/569664027a50a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/569664027a50a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Reverse : with Braille KM# 305.1, KM# 305.2 and KM# 305.3/without Braille (KM# 305.4, listed separately)<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5696643456086.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5696643456086.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5696643e2922b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5696643e2922b.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Obverse : PERU/PERÚ<br>All KM# 305.1 and KM# 305.2 have \"PERU\" on obverse and \"CENTIMOS\" on reverse, both without accent; all KM# 305.3 have \"PERÚ\" and \"CÉNTIMOS\" with accent.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a9225b85e86a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a9225b85e86a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Obverse : different shape of wreath over the coat of arms<br>All KM# 305.1 have round wreath; all KM# 305.2 and KM# 305.3 have oval wreath.</p>",
